  "prefLabel": "Site 102.01 Abutting property",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.01 “Abutting property” means any property that is contiguous to or directly across a road, railroad, or stream from property on, under or above which an energy facility is located or proposed to be located.\n\nSource. #9182, eff 6-17-08; ss by #10993, eff 12-16-15",
